<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87139" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόεδρ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one who sits in the first place,
				president,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.67
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν δίκῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					949a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				3p.44
			</span></i><span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ τῆς μαντείας π. ἀετός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					601b2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> at Athens, in
			pl., <i>presiding officers</i> of the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουλή</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκλησία,</span> Lex
			ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				24.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				2.65
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				44.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ λαχόντες π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.779.11
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				1227.23
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς π. οἳ ἂν λάχωσι προεδρεύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					158.5
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv B.C.)</span>, etc.; <i>similar officers</i> at Mytilene,
				<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ τῶν Αἰτωλῶν π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>Mac.</u>
					9.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλλοντος τοῦ π. τὸν δῆμον ἐπερωτᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Arist.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			, cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιψηφίζω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.2
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. Ἑρμοῦ πόλεως</span>
			<i>city councillors</i> of Hermupolis, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1027 i 10
			</span></i><span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>.</div>
